# Ownership boundaries for amazon-dynamodb-tools.
#
# CODEOWNERS is LAST-MATCH-WINS. Order matters: a specific delegation must
# appear BELOW the broad rule it is meant to override, or it has no effect.

# ---- Repo infrastructure: broad protection, declared first ----
/.github/                                      @relentlesscol

# ---- Per-tool ownership: each tool owns its own directory ----
/tools/dax_calculator/                         @relentlesscol

# ---- Delegated workflow file ----
# This line sits BELOW /.github/ on purpose, so the tool owners (not the repo
# admins) are the code owners of this one workflow. Everything else under
# /.github/ stays admin-owned, so no other workflow can be added or edited
# without an admin review.
#
# In awslabs/startups the equivalent pair would be:
#   /startuplabs/                              @awslabs/startups-startuplabs
#   /.github/workflows/startuplabs.yml         @awslabs/startups-startuplabs
/.github/workflows/dax-calculator-checks.yml   @relentlesscol
